    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange Pong</strong> is a classic Pong game with the addition of new game mechanics. This game is a game of tennis, the player controls a racket and must hit the ball. However, each level has its own features that make the game more interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/58549fec740a8ade348bfd5545fc6ff4.poster.avif?t=1740220325\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/58549fec740a8ade348bfd5545fc6ff4.webm?t=1740220325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/58549fec740a8ade348bfd5545fc6ff4.mp4?t=1740220325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various modifiers that affect gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-player game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music in different genres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to change the game's visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/ab678635f841db213dfbfa92edd77346.poster.avif?t=1740220325\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/ab678635f841db213dfbfa92edd77346.webm?t=1740220325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689460/extras/ab678635f841db213dfbfa92edd77346.mp4?t=1740220325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
